","Search, Crawl Customization","24/7 Priority Service Support"],cta:"Buy credits"}},creditUsage:$R[441]={title:"Credit Usage Guide",description:"Understand how credits are consumed across different features",headers:$R[442]={feature:"Feature",endpoint:"Endpoint",description:"Description",parameters:"Parameters",credits:"Credits"},sections:$R[443]={basic:$R[444]={title:"Basic APIs",description:"Standard credit consumption for basic features",features:$R[445]=[$R[446]={description:"Web search results from multiple engines"},$R[447]={description:"Agentic search: decision-model intent detection, up to 5 engines, AI reranking"},$R[448]={description:"Latest news results from various sources"},$R[449]={description:"Get content from any webpage"},$R[450]={description:"Capture a full webpage, viewport, or page element as an image"},$R[451]={description:"Get website structure and links"},$R[452]={description:"Trending topics from social platforms"},$R[453]={description:"Download entire websites as markdown files"},$R[454]={description:"Extract structured data from webpages"}]},deepSearch:$R[455]={title:"Deep Search",description:"Search results with extracted content from target pages",note:"n = number of successfully crawled pages"}}},notices:$R[456]=["Credit consumption varies by feature"],viewMore:$R[457]={text:"Explore all pricing options",description:"Compare pay-as-you-go pricing and see how credits are used across features."},freeBanner:$R[458]={text:"Not ready to subscribe? Start with 100 free credits — no credit card required."}},languageSwitcher:$R[459]={label:"Switch language"}}},locale:"en"},ssr:!0},$R[460]={i:"␀{-$locale}␀␀",u:1792388565617,s:"success",l:$R[461]={head:$R[462]={meta:$R[463]=[$R[464]={title:"Real-Time Web Search & RAG API for AI Agents | Search1API"},$R[465]={name:"description",content:"Real-time web search, RAG retrieval, crawling, and structured data extraction for AI agents and LLMs. 100 free credits via REST API, MCP server, and CLI."},$R[466]=